  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "image": "books/G1/083/p09.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 887,
   "text": "But the gingerbread man laughed and said, \"Run, run, as fast as you can! You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man! I ran away from the little old woman. I ran away from the little old man. And I can run away from you. I can! I can!\" Down the road, the gingerbread man met a hungry pig. \"Stop! Stop!\" cried the pig. \"I want to eat you!\"",
